{"song_id": 241373, "title": "Pr\u00e9sentation du Crou", "language": "fr", "lyricists": [55334], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Salut. Je te pr\u00e9sente le crou Stup\u00e9flip", "rhyme": "ip", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Form\u00e9 en 1972, le groupe se compose de trois membres :", "rhyme": "#bR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Flip, l'\u00e2me damn\u00e9e du groupe, sans arr\u00eat sous pression", "rhyme": "$", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "(d'o\u00f9 son pseudonyme)", "rhyme": null, "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Pop Hip, v\u00e9ritable t\u00eate de turc du groupe, qui veut absolument faire du rock n'roll", "rhyme": "Ol", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Ainsi que King Ju", "rhyme": "y", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "King Ju, ayant subi de s\u00e9rieux traumatismes durant son enfance", "rhyme": "#s", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Se servira du Crou Stup\u00e9flip pour r\u00e9gler ses comptes avec la soci\u00e9t\u00e9", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Le Crou Stupeflip est l\u00e0, entre autres, pour terroriser la population", "rhyme": "$", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Et par l\u00e0-m\u00eame instaurer une nouvelle \u00e8re : l'\u00e8re du Stup (l'\u00e8re du Stup)", "rhyme": "yp", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "Je tiens \u00e0 signaler \u00e0 mon auditoire que j'ai actuellement un pistolet coll\u00e9 sur la tempe", "rhyme": "#p", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "11", "text": "Je crains pour ma... (Coups de feu)", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABCDEFGHCIJK", "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEFBGCFBH"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "outro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Stup\u00e9flip, truc stupide", "rhyme": "id", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Qui tape dans l'bide", "rhyme": "id", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Trop d'vin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Trop d'joints", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Et voil\u00e0 l'r\u00e9sultat", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBC", "rhyme_vowel": "AABBC"}], "album_id": 24248}